  "principles": [
    "Keep species, hybrids, varieties and cultivars distinct.",
    "Never call calibrated gameplay timing a universal botanical fact.",
    "No causal diagnosis from an isolated symptom or a single pest sighting.",
    "Plant death can be an expected annual life cycle, a stress outcome, or an uncertain cause.",
    "Keep a real-life elapsed clock; model seasons and conditions independently.",
    "Cultivar-specific yield, cold tolerance and pruning are unknown until supported.",
    "Flag regional invasiveness and toxicity; avoid unsafe advice.",
    "No growth or harvest bonus for deliberately killing plants."
  ],
